# --- KroxClient v16.0: build output, local tool state, bulk binaries ---
# Supplied jars stay on disk only. They are third-party binaries we consume
# as-is; committing them is both a license problem and a size problem
# (Flashback alone is 202 MB, past GitHub's 100 MB hard push limit).
Krox/jars/*.jar
Krox/*/*.jar
Krox/*/extracted/
# 3-segment path, so the Krox/*/*.jar rule above misses it. Flashback alone is 211 MB.
Krox/client/libs/
launcher icon/*.jar
Krox/client/build/
Krox/client/.gradle/
Krox/client/run/
*.rvf
*.rvf.lock
*.db
.ruvector/

# ZalithLauncher: signing keystores and the properties file carrying their
# passwords. Both were published on a public branch; keep them local. CI supplies
# the passwords via ORG_GRADLE_PROJECT_*. See .github/workflows/launcher-build.yml.
ZalithLauncher/*.jks
ZalithLauncher/gradle.properties
